        "Finch",
        "Old Finch"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Callirhoe: Old Finch",
      "content": "Finch befriended the Spring Fairy as a boy and became the basis of the Heart of Clear Springs story. He waited by the spring for decades, one of the few in Springvale who believed in her. During Waterborne Poetry (limited event) Diona fetched him to meet Callirhoe, who read him a poem, gave him a droplet of her own power so they could meet in dreams, and kissed him, as she had not in the legend.",
