      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Callirhoe: Diona's blessing",
      "content": "On Diona's seventh birthday, after years of the child confiding in the spring, the Spring Fairy wished her cups would always run over with sweet wine of celebration. From then on, any drink Diona mixes tastes delicious. In 4.1 (limited event) Callirhoe confirms it to Diona.",
