    "2": {
      "uid": 2,
      "key": [
        "Heart of Clear Springs",
        "Spring Fairy legend"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Callirhoe: Heart of Clear Springs",
      "content": "The Springvale legend says a spring fairy saved a mother and her sick son by creating a healing spring, drawing settlers. A book collection tells a second story of a boy who loved the fairy and was left with a parting kiss. In the real events the kiss came decades later, and Finch was still alive.",
