    "3": {
      "uid": 3,
      "key": [
        "Waterborne Poetry",
        "Neighboring Nations Congenial Poetry Gala",
        "poetry gala"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Callirhoe: Waterborne Poetry",
      "content": "In the limited-time event Waterborne Poetry (2023-10-12 to 2023-10-30), Callirhoe joined the Neighboring Nations Congenial Poetry Gala at Stone Gate in human form and drifted poems on leaves down the Bishui River. The Traveler found her beset by hilichurls, where she reverted to a water droplet. With encouragement from Mika and Diona she chose to see Finch again.",
