      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Callirhoe: Endora and the Lochfolk",
      "content": "In the limited-time 1.4 event Wishful Drops, the young Oceanid Endora came to Mondstadt after Rhodeia, a famed Lochfolk scout. She sensed Callirhoe in Springvale's spring and carried her message to Finch: 'Life flows on, so please, begin to move again.'",
